{"schema":1,"revision":94713100,"page":{"pageid":3155582,"title":"司陶特啤酒","displayTitle":"司陶特啤酒","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"noteTA-f58154ab\" class=\"noteTA\"><div class=\"noteTA-local\"><div data-noteta-code=\"zh-hans:世涛; zh-hant:司陶特\"></div></div></div>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Guinness_7686a.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Guinness_7686a.jpg/250px-Guinness_7686a.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"237\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Guinness_7686a.jpg/500px-Guinness_7686a.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1055\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a><figcaption><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%81%A5%E5%8A%9B%E5%A3%AB\" title=\"健力士\">健力士</a>司陶特啤酒，健力士為源自愛爾蘭之啤酒品牌</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>司陶特啤酒</b>（英語：<span lang=\"en\">Stout</span>）是一種酒體呈黑色的<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%95%A4%E9%85%92\" title=\"啤酒\">啤酒</a>，由經過烘焙的<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%BA%A5%E8%8A%BD\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"麥芽\">麥芽</a>或是<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E9%BA%A5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"大麥\">大麥</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%95%A4%E9%85%92%E8%8A%B1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"啤酒花\">啤酒花</a>、酵母及水釀造而成。這種啤酒衍生自<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B3%A2%E7%89%B9%E5%95%A4%E9%85%92\" title=\"波特啤酒\">波特啤酒</a>（Porter）<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-yahoo&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-yahoo-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>，酒精含量4%起，味道較苦，卻有較強的餘韻。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"歷史\"><span id=\".E6.AD.B7.E5.8F.B2\"></span>歷史</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%8F%B8%E9%99%B6%E7%89%B9%E5%95%A4%E9%85%92&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：歷史\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>中文「司陶特」源自英文（Stout），原義是強烈的意思。發源自<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8B%B1%E6%A0%BC%E8%98%AD\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"英格蘭\">英格蘭</a>的波特啤酒，傳入<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%84%9B%E7%88%BE%E8%98%AD\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"愛爾蘭\">愛爾蘭</a>之後，愛爾蘭人將原料由烘烤麥芽改為未發芽的烘烤大麥，形成司陶特啤酒。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"特点\"><span id=\".E7.89.B9.E7.82.B9\"></span>特點</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%8F%B8%E9%99%B6%E7%89%B9%E5%95%A4%E9%85%92&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：特點\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>司陶特色澤深褐，苦味較重，泡沫較少，但有較濃郁的焦香麥芽味及帶有朱古力味。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參考資料\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.80.83.E8.B3.87.E6.96.99\"></span>參考資料</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%8F%B8%E9%99%B6%E7%89%B9%E5%95%A4%E9%85%92&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節：參考資料\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-